# Architecture & build

## Boundaries

- **`Shell` owns all mihomo writes** — UI / in-app agent / MCP call into Shell; no parallel YAML editors
- Prefer small PRs inside existing module boundaries
- Do **not** add a second “just for this case” config, deploy path, or env fork without maintainer alignment (KISS)

## Build / mirror region (single switch)

- Env `REGION=china` → China-friendly mirrors/deps path
- Env `REGION=else` (or unset per scripts) → internet-universal path
- Do not invent extra region keys or parallel build scripts

## Secrets

- No real Hub subscription URLs/tokens in tree (`supone.top` placeholders only)
- Respect `.gitleaks.toml` / pre-commit
- No phub / `PHUB_*` mirror wiring in CI
